        <tr><td>Door keypad</td><td>Wooden door, meeting-room side</td><td>Numeric pad with a display, a clear key and an enter key. Worked at 2:24; display masked on camera.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Cloth</td><td>—</td><td>Pickup at 2:29. Combines with the paint thinner at 2:33 into a <b>Cloth with thinner</b>.</td></tr>
