        <tr><td>Credenza three-dial lock</td><td>Meeting room, under the posters</td><td>Three vertical dials on a wooden drawer front. Worked 3:52–4:05; the drawer is never shown open.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Second laptop</td><td>Meeting room / desk</td><td>Dead until a <b>charger</b> is plugged in at 4:29; screen then shows a charging graphic (4:36).</td></tr>
